  "ownership": [
    "ProfileCapture.unity_response_preview reads the exact original raw-ID source grid and delegates all four unity projections/bounded views to existing numerical owners. A distinct ConfiguredResponsePreview labels synthetic unity and contains no invented measured provenance, epoch or receiver estimate.",
    "RxMerDesign.limits describes existing scientific/resource domains; only the existing four-million saved-Designer evaluation guard becomes a named common constant, independent of playback budgets. No admission value, error message, evaluator, source, saved recipe or schema changes.",
    "Native Python performs selector/buffer/ownership/JSON conversion only. Existing ChannelEstimate projection selection and its native string conversion share private helpers without changing prior behavior. No native DTO class is introduced."
  ],
